<title>BELGIUM: Arbed H1 1996 group net slides into loss.</title>
<headline>Arbed H1 1996 group net slides into loss.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>First-half 1996 earnings</p>
<p>(billion Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net loss (excludes minorities) 0.249 vs   2.409 profit</p>
<p>    Cons net profit			    0.373 vs   4.605</p>
<p>    Turnover				   117.346 vs 135.596</p>
<p>NOTE - Arbed SA is a Luxembourg-based steel group.  </p>
<p>    Gross operating profit		   9.686 vs  16.200</p>
<p>    Cons cashflow				5.450 vs  11.303</p>
<p>    Coporate Investment			6.748 vs   4.279</p>
<p>PRODUCTION (in 1,000s of tonnes)</p>
<p>    Crude steel				 5,684 vs   5,746</p>
<p>     Flat products			    3,141 vs   3,333</p>
<p>     Long products			    1,977 vs   2,162</p>
<p>     Stainless steel			    220 vs     238</p>
<p>     Wire products				410 vs     409</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
